<report>
<title>Friedman test</title>

<p>Variables: @tlist</p>

<p>Mean rank: @rlist</p>

<p>Treatment average sum of squares of ranks = @{a2:roundu}<br />
Number of blocks = @nb<br />
T<sub>1</sub> (chi-square) = @{t1:roundu}<br />
df = @df</p>

<p>After Iman &amp; Davenport (1980):<br />
T<sub>2</sub> (F) = @{t2:roundu}<br />
<pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
<block name="message">

<p>@msg</p>
</block>
<block name="warn">

<p>@warning</p>
</block>
</report>
